 "cmd": "vllm serve Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-CustomVoice --omni --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8091 --deploy-config /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/vllm_omni/deploy/qwen3_tts_high_concurrency_mrv2_single_gpu.yaml --trust-remote-code --stage-init-timeout 1800 --init-timeout 2400 --api-server-count 4",
 "deploy_config": {
  "yaml": "# Experimental single-GPU CUDA/BF16 throughput profile.\n# Optimizations: frame-local predictor KV, fused sampling, time-major codec\n# convolutions, eager residual prediction and first-frame delivery; B1-B8 codec\n# graphs, FULL Talker graphs and 128 Talker slots. Floating-point results differ:\n# validate audio quality for your workload. Ordinary profiles do not enable MPS.\n# cuda_mps starts one private NVIDIA MPS daemon shared by this pipeline's stages\n# and stops it after they exit. An existing CUDA_MPS_PIPE_DIRECTORY is reused\n# without taking ownership. Requires nvidia-cuda-mps-control on PATH.\n# Set cuda_mps: false in an overlay to disable it.\n# MPS can increase throughput under load but also increase first-packet and\n# first-audible-audio latency. Compare cuda_mps: false for latency-sensitive\n# workloads, especially at low request rates.\n# Warm the full pipeline before measuring latency or throughput.\n#\n# vllm serve Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-CustomVoice --omni \\\n#   --deploy-config vllm_omni/deploy/qwen3_tts_high_concurrency_mrv2_single_gpu.yaml \\\n#   --api-server-count 4 --stage-init-timeout 1800 --init-timeout 2400\nbase_config: qwen3_tts_high_concurrency_mrv2.yaml\ncuda_mps: true\n\nconnectors:\n  connector_of_shared_memory:\n    extra:\n      talker_first_audio: true\n      codec_chunk_ramp: null\n      codec_chunk_adaptive: false\n      initial_codec_chunk_frames: 1\n      codec_chunk_frames: 25\n      codec_left_context_frames: 72\n      code_predictor_kv_cache: true\n      code_predictor_fused_sampling: true\n      decode_time_major_conv: true\n      decode_cudnn_benchmark: true\n      decode_batch_max_size: 8\n      decode_cudagraph_batch_sizes: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]\n\nstages:\n  - stage_id: 0\n    devices: \"0\"\n    max_num_seqs: 128\n    compilation_config:\n      cudagraph_mode: FULL\n      cudagraph_capture_sizes: [1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, 56, 64, 72, 80, 88, 96, 104, 112, 120, 128, 144, 160, 176, 192, 208, 224, 240, 256, 272, 288, 304, 320, 336, 352, 368, 384, 400, 416, 432, 448, 464, 480, 496, 512]\n      max_cudagraph_capture_size: 512\n  - stage_id: 1\n    devices: \"0\"\n    max_num_seqs: 64\n    async_scheduling: false\n",
  "qwen3_tts_high_concurrency_mrv2.yaml": "# Opt-in CUDA Model Runner V2 profile. The base profile retains V1.\nbase_config: qwen3_tts_high_concurrency.yaml\nmodel_runner: v2\n\nplatforms:\n  npu:\n    model_runner: v1\n  xpu:\n    model_runner: v1\n  rocm:\n    model_runner: v1\n  musa:\n    model_runner: v1\n\nconnectors:\n  connector_of_shared_memory:\n    extra:\n      talker_first_audio: true\n      # Keep unqualified prefix-graph optimizations disabled in this profile.\n      code_predictor_prefix_graphs: false\n      ref_audio_artifact_cache_max_entries: 1024\n      # Opt-in B2 codec graphs. Validate quality for the deployment workload.\n      decode_batch_max_size: 2\n      decode_cudagraph_batch_sizes: [1, 2]\n\nstages:\n  - stage_id: 1\n    # Enable the decoder's inner graphs; the generation runner stays eager.\n    enforce_eager: false\n",
  "qwen3_tts_high_concurrency.yaml": "# Qwen3-TTS high-concurrency deploy profile.\n#\n# This is intentionally separate from qwen3_tts.yaml. Use it only when running\n# sustained high-concurrency serving on two GPUs, for example:\n#\n#   vllm serve Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base --omni \\\n#     --deploy-config vllm_omni/deploy/qwen3_tts_high_concurrency.yaml\n#\n# Profile validated for the c64 / PROMPTS=512 performance experiments:\n# Stage 0 talker on GPU 0 with S0=64, Stage 1 Code2Wav on GPU 1 with S1=10.\n#\n# For CPU-bound frontend or orchestration workloads, this profile can be used\n# with ``--api-server-count 2`` or higher to run multiple API frontends over\n# one shared set of local stage engines. This can improve request parsing,\n# multimodal/audio preprocessing, and response handling under concurrency;\n# it does not duplicate GPU engines or make a single GPU-bound request faster.\n# Each frontend keeps process-local state, so runtime voice mutations, sleep /\n# wakeup, async video jobs, and resumable duplex sessions are not supported\n# with more than one API worker. See docs/cli/serve.md for the full boundary.\n#\nasync_chunk: true\n\nconnectors:\n  connector_of_shared_memory:\n    name: SharedMemoryConnector\n    extra:\n      talker_first_audio: true\n      codec_streaming: true\n      connector_get_sleep_s: 0.01\n      connector_get_max_wait_first_chunk: 3000\n      connector_get_max_wait: 300\n      codec_chunk_frames: 25\n      codec_left_context_frames: 72\n      # Stage0 code-predictor prefix CUDA graphs for the c64 hot path.\n      # These keys are consumed by Qwen3-TTS talker and ignored by Code2Wav.\n      code_predictor_prefix_graphs: true\n      code_predictor_prefix_graph_buckets: [64]\n      code_predictor_prefix_graph_seq_lens: [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]\n      # Keep voice-clone reference context bounded so Stage1 chunk lengths are\n      # stable across different reference-audio durations.\n      ref_code_context_frames: 72\n      # Emit only the first audio chunk early, then return to codec_chunk_frames.\n      initial_codec_chunk_frames: 1\n      # Chunk ramp (opt-in): gradual size increase for first N chunks to\n      # eliminate the IC\u2192steady cliff (1\u219225). Uncomment to enable.\n      # Each entry is the size of that chunk index; indices past the table\n      # fall back to codec_chunk_frames. When enabled, ramp overrides\n      # initial_codec_chunk_frames (including the per-request API field).\n      # Example:\n      #   codec_chunk_ramp: [4, 4, 8, 16, 25]\n      # Adaptive chunk ramp (opt-in, takes precedence over fixed codec_chunk_ramp):\n      # Chunk 0 uses dynamic IC; chunk 1+ sizes from live buffer-depth feedback.\n      # Self-tunes across hardware (NPU/NVIDIA) and load conditions.\n      # codec_chunk_adaptive: true\n      # codec_chunk_min_frames: 2\n      # Code2Wav decode + transfer margin\n      # codec_chunk_safety_margin_ms: 50\n      # EWMA->delta divisor (delta=max(delta_min, int(ewma/divisor))); higher=gentler ramp\n      # codec_chunk_ramp_divisor: 15\n      # min chunk-size growth per emit\n      # codec_chunk_ramp_delta_min: 2\n      # async_chunk derives stateful ICL/xvec graph shapes from the ramp when\n      # enabled, otherwise from the fixed chunk settings above, and ignores\n      # decode_cudagraph_capture_sizes. Keep B>1\n      # captures opt-in; c64 e2e validation did not show a stable win.\n      decode_cudagraph_batch_sizes: [1]\n      decode_batch_max_size: 1\n      decode_enable_tf32: false\n\nstages:\n  - stage_id: 0\n    max_num_seqs: 64\n    gpu_memory_utilization: 0.3\n    trust_remote_code: true\n    enable_prefix_caching: false\n    async_scheduling: true\n    max_num_batched_tokens: 512\n    max_model_len: 4096\n    devices: \"0\"\n    output_connectors:\n      to_stage_1: connector_of_shared_memory\n    default_sampling_params:\n      temperature: 0.9\n      top_k: 50\n      max_tokens: 4096\n      # Official qwen-tts generates the talker with min_new_tokens=2; without\n      # it, checkpoints that sample codec EOS on the first frame return empty\n      # audio (HTTP 400). See #4962.\n      min_tokens: 2\n      repetition_penalty: 1.05\n    subtalker_sampling_params:\n      do_sample: true\n      temperature: 0.9\n      top_k: 50\n      top_p: 1.0\n\n  - stage_id: 1\n    # Decoder compute dtype on GPU/NPU; 310P requires FP16 and overrides this.\n    dtype: bfloat16\n    max_num_seqs: 10\n    gpu_memory_utilization: 0.3\n    enforce_eager: true\n    trust_remote_code: true\n    enable_prefix_caching: false\n    async_scheduling: true\n    max_num_batched_tokens: 65536\n    max_model_len: 65536\n    devices: \"1\"\n    input_connectors:\n      from_stage_0: connector_of_shared_memory\n    default_sampling_params:\n      temperature: 0.0\n      top_p: 1.0\n      top_k: -1\n      max_tokens: 65536\n      repetition_penalty: 1.0\n\nplatforms:\n  npu:\n    stages:\n      - stage_id: 0\n        enforce_eager: true\n"
 },
